# BAWAAL Core System Specification (LOCKED)

Production-final product contract. Do **not** restyle, re-clutter, or rewire unless the user explicitly unlocks this rule.

## 1. Brand identity & aesthetic

| Token | Value |
|---|---|
| Theme | Minimalist elite **underground arena** |
| Background | Pitch black `#000000` |
| Accent | Sports orange `#FF5500` |
| Type | Clean high-contrast white |
| Philosophy | Zero clutter — video / raw action owns the frame |

## 2. Video feed & metrics

- Feed UI stays a clean, distraction-free player surface (no sport category pills on clips — see `bawaal-ui-baseline.mdc`).
- **Metrics** (likes, shares, reshared counts, deep stats) stay **behind** the bottom-right **⋮** / action sheet — never as permanent chrome on the primary video overlay.
- Canonical reel geometry: `src/constants/arenaReelOverlay.js` + `bawaal-v2-arena-ui-locked.mdc`.

## 3. Creator Studio — BAWAAL Hub (6 modes)

Hub modal on `UniversalCamera` (`BawaalHubDrawer` / `HUB_MODES`). Tap → capture mode + rules → dismiss Hub → arm the lens.

| Mode | Brand | Rules |
|---|---|---|
| SPARKS | Stories | 30s max · vanishes in 24h |
| JOSH | Reels | 60s default · unlock to 180s with coins |
| BAWAAL BATTLE | Group Challenge | Multi-participant group challenge |
| DARK ARENA | Open Challenge | Anyone posts / anyone participates |
| FACEOFF | Response Challenge | Athlete challenges; others answer |
| WAR CRY | 1v1 Live | Live 1v1 → battle setup form |

**Camera HUD (LOCKED):** one centered semi-transparent broadcast pill only — `[MODE] • [DETAILS]` (e.g. `WAR CRY • LIVE 1v1`). No duplicate timer / mode badges. Hub handoff via `hubHandoff` must not fall back to opener titles after a Hub pick.

## 4. Proprietary skeleton + skull vault (121+)

- Central registry: `components/BawaalEmoji.js` + `src/constants/bawaalEmojiAssets.js` (`SKULL_EMOJIS` / `SKULL_EMOJI_KEYS` / `ALL_SKELETON_KEYS`).
- Shortcodes (`:skull_angry:`, `:skull_fire:`, `:skull_burning:`, `:love:`, …) via `bawaalEmojiText.js`.
- Banter / Vault: `FullEmojiPickerDrawer` + Banter FlatList virtualization.
- **Full-screen Arena reactions:** proprietary skeleton/skull PNGs only — **never** unicode / system emoji.
- Detail lock: `bawaal-emoji-locked.mdc`.

## 5. Technical standards

- React Native / Expo; FlatList virtualization for chat / vault / feeds.
- Cross-platform touch (web + native); no platform-only assumptions without `Platform.OS` gates.
- Related locks: `bawaal-challengecam-locked.mdc`, `bawaal-arena-video-playback-locked.mdc`, `bawaal-core-project.mdc`.

## Never re-add

- Metric counters / share counts on the primary reel canvas
- Dual header pills on the camera (timer + mode HUD)
- Unicode reaction trays on Arena / Banter / DMs
- Extra Hub modes or local Hub mode arrays outside `HUB_MODES`
